abstract: >-
  Chapter-organized Python notebooks accompanying the textbook Introduction to
  Compressible Flows, covering Rayleigh flow, oblique shocks, shock polars,
  interacting shocks, shock tubes, converging-diverging nozzles, and conical
  flow through transparent analytical and numerical teaching implementations.
